PACKAGE DESCRIPTION:
oldlibs:  Shared X libraries from XFree86 2.1.1 (X11R5).
oldlibs:
oldlibs:  This package adds libX11.so.3.1.0, libXaw.so.3.1.0, and
oldlibs:  libXt.so.3.1.0 to your /usr/X11R6/lib directory.  Although most 
oldlibs:  X software in Slackware has been recompiled to use the new X
oldlibs:  libraries, there's still plenty of software out there that will
oldlibs:  require these libraries for compatibility with XFree86 3.1.
oldlibs:
oldlibs:  Some things that currently require these libraries: the XV series,
oldlibs:  workman, and DOOM.
